  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The gamer's readiness to play is mapped to the person aiming the rifle.",
  "description": "The text 'when the new call of duty comes out and you're already camping' describes a gamer's state of being deeply immersed in the game (camping) upon the release of a new Call of Duty. The visual of the person aiming a rifle out the window is mapped to this state, symbolizing the gamer's focused, anticipatory, and ready-to-engage posture. The act of aiming the weapon visually represents the gamer's mental state of being 'camped out' and prepared to play immediately.",
